--TEST--
`===` is refused with `E0232`, and the parser recovers it as a comparison, so the names on either side stay named while the operator itself receives no token — there is no operator type in the legend to dress it in — `rule:expressions/one-equality-operator`, `rule:ide/rejected-syntax-gets-no-colour`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Real {}
var $a = 1;
var $same = $a === $a;
var $b = 2;
--REQUEST--
semanticTokens
--EXPECT--
